Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.5 fixes the SwiftUI host matcher, which missed UIHostingContentView entirely and so reported hosts_found 0 on screens that are SwiftUI, and adds a separate swiftui_views count for views SwiftUI draws itself. 0.5.4 added a repeating scan; 0.5.0 added layer and gradient colour. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

